      "category": "economy",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Paleontologists study fossils in Sewell, a site that echoes the early work of Edward Drinker Cope in the late 1800s.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        16
